### ===== MAHASISWA =====

### PUT
PUT http://localhost:3001/mahasiswa/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nama": "Ollie Baru", "email": "ollie@baru.com", "jurusan": "Teknik Informatika" }

### PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:3001/mahasiswa/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nama": "Jake Updated" }

### DELETE
DELETE http://localhost:3001/mahasiswa/3

### ===== PRODUK =====

### CREATE produk
POST http://localhost:3001/produk
Content-Type: application/json

{ "namaBarang": "StickerEnchin", "stock": 7, "harga": 80000 }

### READ semua produk
GET http://localhost:3001/produk

### READ satu produk
GET http://localhost:3001/produk/6

### UPDATE produk
PUT http://localhost:3001/produk/6
Content-Type: application/json

{ "namaBarang": "EnchinLamp", "stock": 17, "harga": 1200000 }

### DELETE produk
DELETE http://localhost:3001/produk/4
